        "id": 226605,
        "name": "Caerulo",
        "username": "Caerulo",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/7bcc69/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-04-25T13:56:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This is what I've gathered so far from looking at all the logs from here, Discord and Steam:</p>\n<p>Conditions:<br>\n- Akash'Thriya in team<br>\n- Play in Nexus of the Void<br>\n- Bring Akash'Thriya down to less than 10 health, and then healed to full<br>\n- Akash'Flora must be played and cannot be destroyed<br>\n- At least 4 different&nbsp;seeds&nbsp;must be played from environment/Play at least (H) seeds from the environment</p>\n<p>Conditions that can be eliminated:<br>\n- No requirements for any other heroes<br>\n- No requirements for any villian<br>\n- No requirements for Akash'Flora to be at a particular health<br>\n- No requirements for Akash'Flora to grant any powers<br>\n- No requirements for all five seeds to be played</p>\n<p><br>\nVariables that still need to be tested:<br>\n- Is the life threshold at 10 hp?&nbsp;<br>\n- How many seeds must be played?<br>\n- Must the seed condition be unique seeds?<br>\n- Must the seeds&nbsp;be played by the environment?</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:00:35.768Z",
