        "id": 226606,
        "name": "Andy7675",
        "username": "Andy7675",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/b3f665/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-04-25T16:17:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So has anyone who failed ever had Akashflora destroyed?</p>\n<p>could the unlock be related to \"Heal Akash a certain amount while Akashflora is in play before winning?\"</p>\n<p>It would make sense with the lore that once she spends her life force making Flora, she gets healed while it's in play!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>thoughts?</p>",
