      {
        "id": 226607,
        "name": "Caerulo",
        "username": "Caerulo",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/7bcc69/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-04-25T16:35:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Andy7675\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/b3f665/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Andy7675:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So has anyone who failed ever had Akashflora destroyed?</p>\n<p>could the unlock be related to “Heal Akash a certain amount while Akashflora is in play before winning?”</p>\n<p>It would make sense with the lore that once she spends her life force making Flora, she gets healed while it’s in play!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>thoughts?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>New logs show that Akash’Flora cannot be destroyed, I’ll be editing my post above to reflect that.</p>\n<p>As for the second point, seems unlikely to be a condition as in my unlock, Akash’Flora only healed Akash’Thriya for 1hp before ending, and Akash’Thriya only gained a total of 5hp before I ended it</p>",
