        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-04-25T17:29:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Only one I might be able to help clarify is the threshold. I got down to 9 hp before healing up, so it appears you don't have to go lower than that, which certainly looks like 10hp is the threshold.</p>\n<p>As an aside, the dichotomy and reflection between the two Akash'Thriya's is an intersting insight inrto different mindsets of growth and destruction.</p>",
