        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-04-25T23:21:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The community has discovered the official unlock condition for Akash'Thriya: Spirit of the Void.</p>\n<p><strong>Win a game in Nexus of the Void with Akash'Thriya on the team. Each unique primordial seed must enter the environment deck. Akash'Thriya must be reduced to 9 or less HP, then recover back to full HP. Akash'Flora must be in play at the end of the game without ever having left play.</strong></p>",
